TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oo, güzel!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Misafirin var!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Peki misafir gelince en çok ne yaparsın?{{TAG:0008:0002:03000000090000000E00000011000000}}
Balığa çıkarım!
Böcek avlarım!
Alışveriş yaparım!
Sır!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ah! Sei sicur{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} di sentirti bene?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Gettare la lenza mentre si trema
per il freddo? Mah...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, cool! That's quite an image—{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
you and your company catching
bugs among the cherry blossoms!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oo, havalı! Gözümde canlandı—{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
sen ve misafirin kiraz çiçekleri
arasında böcek yakalıyorsunuz!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Che?! Mi pare una cosa folle!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Che insetti si troveranno mai
in mezzo alla neve?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}¡¿Ein?! ¡¿Qué andas tramando?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Hala, muy bonito, ahora ya estoy
toda intrigada...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Was habt ihr denn vor?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}} Boah, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
vorher war's nur 'ne Höflichkeits-
frage, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}aber jetzt will ich's wissen!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Gah! Like a secret mission?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}} What
are you planning on doing in the
dead of night?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¿Qué pasa, es como una misión
secreta o algo así?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}} A saber qué
tramáis... ¡Ji, ji!{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Gné ?! Ça sent la mission secrète !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Qu'est-ce qu'vous allez bien pouvoir
trafiquer au beau milieu d'la nuit ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Ah! Sei in missione segreta o che?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Che cosa potrai mai avere in mente
di fare nel cuore della notte?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Wat! Soll das 'ne Geheimmission
werden?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}} Was zur heiligen Butter-
blume habt ihr denn vor?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ha, doğru! Az önce misafirini gördüm!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}
Biliyorsun, {{TAG:0005:000E:0000}}
ziyaretçiler için iyi
bir yer!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sonra gidip bir sohbet ederim
artık! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Wenn du viele Freunde zu Besuch
hast,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} kann es ganz schön nerven,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
sie einzeln zu verabschieden{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Deshalb hab ich 'nen Tipp für dich:{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Drücke {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}START{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} und wähle dann
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Besucher heimschicken{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dann geht jeder in seine Stadt
zurück!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Versuch's mal!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
